      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Sync Datamate with Odoo\n### This node will update Odoo Contacts that have a EVI District number present in the 'EVI_DistID' field.\n##### This info is found on the Odoo contacts under the 'Integration' tab.  The following fields will be updated:\nEVI District Name, EVI Last Sync, EVI Last Login, Student Info System, State District ID.\n\n**This is a **Sync** operation so it will add and remove remove tags from odoo that match [EVICore](https://apps.edvistas.com).\n",
